    "title": "<p>Risk stratification model to predict the progression of monoclonal gammopathy of undetermined significance (MGUS) to myeloma or a related disorder</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Adapted, with permission from Elsevier, from: Rajkumar SV, Kyle RA, Therneau TM, et al. Serum free light chain ratio is an independent risk factor for progression in monoclonal gammopathy of undetermined significance. Blood. 2005 Aug 1;106(3):812&ndash;7. PMID:15855274.",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 708.7pt; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" width=\"945\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 286.45pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid black; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"382\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Risk group based on the following risk factors:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">1. serum M&nbsp;protein &gt;&nbsp;1.5&nbsp;g/dL</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">2. IgA or IgM subtype</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">3. elevated free light chain ratio &gt;&nbsp;1.65</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 101.7pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid black; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"136\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Relative risk</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 160.25pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid black; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"214\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Absolute risk of progression at 20&nbsp;years</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 160.3pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid black; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"214\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Absolute risk of progression at 20&nbsp;years accounting for death as a competing risk</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 286.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"382\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Low risk</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> (no risk factors present)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 101.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"136\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">1</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 160.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"214\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">5%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 160.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"214\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">2%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 286.45pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"382\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Low to intermediate risk</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> (any one risk factor present)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 101.7pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"136\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">5.4</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 160.25pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"214\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">21%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 160.3pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"214\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">10%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 286.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"382\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">High to intermediate risk</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> (any two risk factors present)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 101.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"136\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">10.1</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 160.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"214\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">37%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 160.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"214\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">18%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 286.45pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"382\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">High risk</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> (all three risk factors present)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 101.7pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"136\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">20.8</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 160.25pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"214\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">58%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 160.3pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"214\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">27%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
