    "title": "<p>Diagnostic criteria for monoclonal gammopathy of undetermined significance (MGUS)</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Adapted, with permission from the Lancet and Elsevier, from:&nbsp;Rajkumar SV, Dimopoulos MA, Palumbo A, et al. International Myeloma Working Group updated criteria for the diagnosis of multiple myeloma. Lancet Oncol. 2014 Nov;15(12):e538&ndash;48. PMID:25439696.",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGridLight\" style=\"width: 707.1pt; background: #daeef3; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"0\" width=\"943\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 707.1pt; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; border-right: none; background: transparent; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"943\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Non-IgM MGUS</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 707.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"943\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Essential:</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 707.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"943\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"FR\">Serum monoclonal protein (non-IgM type) &lt;&nbsp;3&nbsp;g/dL</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 707.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"943\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Clonal bone marrow plasma cells &lt;&nbsp;10%<sup>a</sup></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 707.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"943\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Absence of end-organ damage, such as CRAB, that can be attributed to the plasma cell proliferative disorder</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 707.1pt; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; border-right: none; background: transparent; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"943\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Light chain MGUS</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 707.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"943\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Essential:</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 707.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"943\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Abnormal FLC ratio (&lt;&nbsp;0.26 or &gt;&nbsp;1.65)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 707.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"943\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Increased level of the appropriate involved light chain (increased kappa FLC in patients with ratio &gt;&nbsp;1.65 and increased lambda FLC in patients with ratio &lt;&nbsp;0.26)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 707.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"943\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">No immunoglobulin heavy chain expression on immunofixation</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 707.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"943\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Absence of end-organ damage that can be attributed to the plasma cell proliferative disorder</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 707.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"943\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Clonal bone marrow plasma cells &lt;&nbsp;10%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 707.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"943\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Urinary monoclonal protein &lt;&nbsp;500&nbsp;mg/24&nbsp;h</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">CRAB, hypercalcaemia, renal insufficiency, anaemia, and bone lesions; FLC, free light chain.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><sup><span lang=\"EN-GB\">a</span></sup><span lang=\"EN-GB\">A</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> bone marrow biopsy can be deferred in patients with low-risk MGUS (IgG type, M&nbsp;protein &lt;&nbsp;15&nbsp;g/L, normal FLC ratio) in whom there are no clinical features concerning for myeloma.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Note: For each entity, all criteria must be met.</span></p>",
